From 4836df80156257c7081b07f279aa84da3bc3608d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:01:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WhatsApp-style DMs: voice notes, photos, videos and file
 attachments
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- direct_messages gains an attachments jsonb column; a message can be
  media-only now (body check allows an empty caption when files are attached)
- new dm-media storage bucket with read/insert/delete policies
- ChatComposer: paperclip file picker with preview queue and mic button with
  MediaRecorder voice notes (2-minute cap, stop + discard, mic error toasts)
- ChatMessageBubble: renders images, playable voice notes, videos and
  downloadable files inside the bubble, caption under the media
- thread list shows Photo / Voice note / Video / File for media-only messages
  and the You: prefix is translated at last
- friends list action button label is تواصل as requested
- next.config.ts: drop turbopack.root (__dirname breaks the TS config loader)

